 include attention checks, speedster detection, straight-line response checks, duplicate or inconsistent answer screening, and open-ended gibberish review. Because the audience is Indian, the survey will avoid leading agree/disagree batteries and will use direct, neutral phrasing."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Survey Routing Logic:"]],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Skip Logic:"]," Irrelevant pregnancy, childcare, leave, or return-to-work questions will be bypassed."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Branching:"]," Expecting parents and parents already caring for a child will r"],"\n"]],[[32,513]]]]]],[[36,568]],[[36,569]]]]]]]],[[236,75]],[[526,191]]]]]],[[36,592]]]]]]]]]],[[542,507]],[[542,508]],[[542,509]]],[[542,656]],[[508,178]],[[526,236]],[[508,179]],[[138,599]],[[36,602]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":323381.023,"wallTime":1786695455406,"collectionTime":2.9000000059604645,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
