},"See why"]]]],[[4,86]],[[4,97]],[[4,98]],[[4,100]],[[4,101]],["P",{},"A sample of 500 respondents provides a strong directional read for the defined audience and supports subgroup comparisons across work model, parent status, caregiving responsibility, childcare access, and employer support availability. Results will be interpreted as survey estimates for the targeted audience rather than as a national probability estimate."],"\n",["P",{},"The question mix will combine behavioural frequency measures, fully labelled five-point severity and usefulness scales, forced prioritisation, and open-ended probes only at high-value decision points. Data collection will use verified Indian respondents with age, gender, city, and NCCS targeting enforced before survey entry."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Data Collection Approach:"]," SuperJ mobile application and web panel, with audience targeting enforced before survey start."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Quality Controls:"]," Attention checks, speeder removal, straight-line detection, duplicate and inconsistency screening, and open-ended gibberish filtering."],"\n",["HR"],"\n",["H3",{"node":"[object Object]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 gap-[8px] flex items-center","style":"transform: translateZ(0px);"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/icons/asterisk.svg","alt":"star icon","class":"hchat-icon flex-shrink-0","src":"/icons/asterisk.svg","style":"width: 18px; height: 18px; min-width: 18px; min-height: 18px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; will-change: transform;"}],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Target Audience"]," [See why](hercules://expla"]]]],[[80,513]]]]]],[[84,568]],[[84,569]]]]]]]],[[284,75]],[[574,191]]]]]],[[84,592]]]]]]]]]],[[590,507]],[[590,508]],[[590,509]]],[[590,656]],[[556,178]],[[574,236]],[[556,179]],[[186,599]],[[84,602]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":383747.853,"wallTime":1786695515773,"collectionTime":2.5,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
